{"title":"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55625ec87739f32fef9893563aeaf1a26a3fa90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccbfe76b010130e27cc2e75b5cfc85d80353060f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110470a070dc5963503a08f1f573c7006f9ea02a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + z = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/3536cf66a9553a36fbdbd6e57b1de2ab6b13e847.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 13 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 17 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"437\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110470a070dc5963503a08f1f573c7006f9ea02a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + z = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55625ec87739f32fef9893563aeaf1a26a3fa90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/0/b9067ef925a7a786d5bccfbe9f57d2b5fdf9cd85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 18 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/f/f1f8fa996f041bba640aeba911c2fd3e1bce0974.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 25 - 18 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Next, plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccbfe76b010130e27cc2e75b5cfc85d80353060f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d17506999a401e6196b5606ed01537cdbdd4e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 + y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d857c3477b8770e8b90a17563304f48fc3e7b282.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 19 - 7 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"174\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccbfe76b010130e27cc2e75b5cfc85d80353060f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55625ec87739f32fef9893563aeaf1a26a3fa90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37c5410ba08bbed3c644c6a09ecb97e0925a55bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19 + z = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/7/db73e8cbf0d0aa2786a827df5505ccc1aceca1fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 25 - 19 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Next, plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/781a1eab5324128a6b9b805f38a10a53badd7f3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 6$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110470a070dc5963503a08f1f573c7006f9ea02a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + z = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b17d3478cc3d7ec89ec6582a7c74242eb0fc98b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 6 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/f/44f0d7a00be86749180e36cbda1d2c35543cdd31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 18 - 6 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"174\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that the second and third equations have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Adding together <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccbfe76b010130e27cc2e75b5cfc85d80353060f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110470a070dc5963503a08f1f573c7006f9ea02a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + z = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5ac540a00b70e0fe53c329bbbdce0757707b1c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + y + z = 19 + 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a47efd6770802b432f2324419bbcaf35025fa712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z + y = 37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55625ec87739f32fef9893563aeaf1a26a3fa90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b86884560997702e20162fb38016f6f1671fb2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 + y = 37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/5/015e76b3f5c2d69dbf1c863637117241db8c05bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 37 - 25 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"183\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley\">1998 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></